 style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2011</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년부터 실시하여 제</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">회를 맞이한 금번 공모전에 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔명조; FONT-SIZE: 7pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 490pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 